{"id":"legacy-recipe-3efc1acf-c6db-4afb-91ac-ec5b963fb3b1","version":1,"category":"amenity","when":"Existing pool recipe; original compatible scales: family, luxury.","title":"Modern Tropical Horizon Pool 01","combinations":"[{\"kind\":\"requires\",\"note\":\"adjoin the long access side\",\"target\":\"patio\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"within 4 m of covered outdoor living\",\"target\":\"terrace\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"at one pool end with clear sightlines\",\"target\":\"cabana\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"place near the shallow end\",\"target\":\"hot-tub\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"use layered tropical screening on privacy edges\",\"target\":\"garden\"},{\"kind\":\"conflicts\",\"note\":\"maintain a planted acoustic buffer\",\"target\":\"driveway\"}]","placement":"Align the long axis with the strongest garden or ocean view. Place the tanning ledge nearest the house for supervised family use. Use a flush or infinity edge only toward an open view or falling grade. Keep one long deck edge clear for loungers and circulation. Conceal pool equipment behind planting or a service screen. Light steps, ledges, and perimeter edges with low-glare warm fixtures.","principles":"Adapt approved guidance to the brief. Parameter options: [{\"key\":\"poolLength\",\"max\":20,\"min\":8,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":12},{\"key\":\"poolWidth\",\"max\":7.5,\"min\":3,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":4.5},{\"key\":\"waterDepth\",\"max\":1.6,\"min\":1.1,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":1.35},{\"key\":\"tanningLedgeDepth\",\"max\":3.5,\"min\":1.5,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":2.2},{\"key\":\"tanningLedgeWidth\",\"max\":5,\"min\":2,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":3.2},{\"key\":\"deckClearance\",\"max\":4,\"min\":1.5,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":2.4},{\"key\":\"edgeTreatment\",\"value\":\"infinity\",\"options\":[\"infinity\",\"flush\",\"raised\"]},{\"key\":\"waterlineFinish\",\"value\":\"dark-stone\",\"options\":[\"dark-stone\",\"pale-stone\",\"glass-mosaic\"]},{\"key\":\"underwaterLighting\",\"value\":\"warm-white\",\"options\":[\"warm-white\",\"cool-white\",\"rgb\"]}].","capabilities":"Required capabilities: . Check against the scene construction contract; approval does not implement capabilities.","sources":[{"reference":"library recipe 3efc1acf-c6db-4afb-91ac-ec5b963fb3b1","note":"Existing recipe approval; no new external verification.","kind":"repository","verified":false}],"construction":{"operations":["add","attach","place-on","finish"],"requiredKinds":["plate","wall","roof"],"materials":"Choose among ivory, limestone, timber, bronze and sage to suit the brief; no custom textures or specialist material certification.","supports":"Connect floors, enclosure, actual openings and overhead shelter as applicable; align supports and datums. Elevated decks need guards and actual access.","unsupported":"Required capabilities: . Check against the scene construction contract; approval does not implement capabilities. No automatic circulation, engineering, service equipment or code compliance verification."}}
{"id":"legacy-recipe-15dd352f-73be-4803-a630-d590ba125c97","version":1,"category":"arrival","when":"Existing entry-sequence recipe; original compatible scales: family, luxury.","title":"Modern Tropical Driveway Threshold 01","combinations":"[{\"kind\":\"requires\",\"note\":\"form a clear vehicle approach from the site entry\",\"target\":\"driveway\"},{\"kind\":\"requires\",\"note\":\"terminate on the protected pedestrian arrival route\",\"target\":\"entry\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"provide a direct branch before the main entry threshold\",\"target\":\"garage\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"use planting to screen parking and frame the approach\",\"target\":\"arrival-garden\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"coordinate low-glare guidance lighting along edges\",\"target\":\"lighting\"},{\"kind\":\"conflicts\",\"note\":\"keep vehicle circulation separate from pool access\",\"target\":\"pool\"}]","placement":"Align the approach toward a framed view of the entrance rather than the garage door. Use a widened turning bay that doubles as a discreet guest drop-off. Set the gate back from the property line to create a vehicle holding apron. Use permeable pale paving with a salt-resistant finish suitable for beach conditions. Layer palms and coastal planting at the edges without narrowing vehicle clearance. Keep bollards low, warm, and shielded from ocean-facing views. Separate the pedestrian route with a raised planted island or textured paving band.","principles":"Adapt approved guidance to the brief. Parameter options: [{\"key\":\"drivewayWidth\",\"max\":7.2,\"min\":4.8,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":5.8},{\"key\":\"arrivalLength\",\"max\":42,\"min\":14,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":24},{\"key\":\"turningDiameter\",\"max\":16,\"min\":9,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":12},{\"key\":\"pavingJointWidth\",\"max\":0.025,\"min\":0.006,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":0.012},{\"key\":\"permeablePaving\",\"unit\":\"boolean\",\"value\":true},{\"key\":\"pavingFinish\",\"unit\":\"string\",\"value\":\"sand-toned-stone\",\"options\":[\"sand-toned-stone\",\"exposed-aggregate\",\"large-format-concrete\",\"coral-limestone\"]},{\"key\":\"gateType\",\"unit\":\"string\",\"value\":\"recessed-sliding\",\"options\":[\"none\",\"recessed-sliding\",\"pivot-gate\",\"timber-screen-gate\"]},{\"key\":\"bollardSpacing\",\"max\":6,\"min\":3,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":4.5},{\"key\":\"arrivalLighting\",\"max\":35,\"min\":8,\"unit\":\"lux\",\"value\":18}].","capabilities":"Required capabilities: . Check against the scene construction contract; approval does not implement capabilities.","sources":[{"reference":"library recipe 15dd352f-73be-4803-a630-d590ba125c97","note":"Existing recipe approval; no new external verification.","kind":"repository","verified":false}],"construction":{"operations":["add","attach","place-on","finish"],"requiredKinds":["plate","wall","roof"],"materials":"Choose among ivory, limestone, timber, bronze and sage to suit the brief; no custom textures or specialist material certification.","supports":"Connect floors, enclosure, actual openings and overhead shelter as applicable; align supports and datums. Elevated decks need guards and actual access.","unsupported":"Required capabilities: . Check against the scene construction contract; approval does not implement capabilities. No automatic circulation, engineering, service equipment or code compliance verification."}}
{"id":"legacy-recipe-21d1571a-86f7-4226-bb31-33b2677f13ec","version":1,"category":"climate-site","when":"Existing planting recipe; original compatible scales: family, luxury.","title":"Modern Tropical Poolside Planting Garden 01","combinations":"[{\"kind\":\"requires\",\"note\":\"along one or more non-access pool edges\",\"target\":\"pool\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"visible from covered outdoor living areas\",\"target\":\"terrace\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"screen service edges without blocking circulation\",\"target\":\"outdoor-kitchen\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"uplight selected palms and specimen foliage\",\"target\":\"lighting\"},{\"kind\":\"conflicts\",\"note\":\"avoid dense planting at vehicle sightlines\",\"target\":\"driveway\"}]","placement":"Layer palms, broadleaf understory, and low groundcover from back to front. Frame ocean or garden views rather than forming a continuous visual wall. Keep pool access paths and emergency egress clear. Use salt-tolerant species on exposed beach sites. Cluster boulders and sculptural plants as deliberate focal points. Conceal pool equipment and boundary edges with dense evergreen foliage. Maintain a restrained palette of repeated tropical species for a modern composition.","principles":"Adapt approved guidance to the brief. Parameter options: [{\"key\":\"bedDepth\",\"max\":5,\"min\":1.2,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":2.4},{\"key\":\"canopyPalmSpacing\",\"max\":8,\"min\":3.5,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":5.5},{\"key\":\"understoryPlantDensity\",\"max\":5,\"min\":1.5,\"unit\":\"plants/m²\",\"value\":2.8},{\"key\":\"groundcoverCoverage\",\"max\":95,\"min\":40,\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":72},{\"key\":\"featureBoulderCount\",\"max\":16,\"min\":0,\"unit\":\"count\",\"value\":5},{\"key\":\"pathClearance\",\"max\":2,\"min\":0.9,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":1.2},{\"key\":\"accentLighting\",\"unit\":\"boolean\",\"value\":true},{\"key\":\"plantingCharacter\",\"unit\":\"string\",\"value\":\"layered-lush\",\"options\":[\"layered-lush\",\"sculptural-minimal\",\"coastal-resilient\"]}].","capabilities":"Required capabilities: . Check against the scene construction contract; approval does not implement capabilities.","sources":[{"reference":"library recipe 21d1571a-86f7-4226-bb31-33b2677f13ec","note":"Existing recipe approval; no new external verification.","kind":"repository","verified":false}],"construction":{"operations":["add","attach","place-on","finish"],"requiredKinds":["plate","wall","roof"],"materials":"Choose among ivory, limestone, timber, bronze and sage to suit the brief; no custom textures or specialist material certification.","supports":"Connect floors, enclosure, actual openings and overhead shelter as applicable; align supports and datums. Elevated decks need guards and actual access.","unsupported":"Required capabilities: . Check against the scene construction contract; approval does not implement capabilities. No automatic circulation, engineering, service equipment or code compliance verification."}}
{"id":"tropical-envelope","version":1,"category":"envelope","when":"Hot humid coastal or island contexts.","title":"Caribbean climate and envelope","combinations":"Pair shaded glazing with sheltered outdoor living and selective screening.","placement":"Place openings for potential cross ventilation and shelter entrances from driving rain; orientation and wind are assumptions until supplied.","principles":"Prioritize shade, weather protection and maintainable coastal materials; request local hurricane and corrosion engineering.","capabilities":"Screens, overhangs and openings can be constructed; no wind, corrosion, thermal or hurricane certification.","sources":[{"reference":"src/lib/villa/scene/designGuide.ts","kind":"repository","verified":true,"note":"Curated contextual application of the existing design guide; capability claims checked against scene/terra.ts and component-registry.ts."}],"construction":{"operations":["add","attach","place-on","finish"],"requiredKinds":["wall"],"materials":"Choose among ivory, limestone, timber, bronze and sage to suit the brief; no custom textures or specialist material certification.","supports":"Connect floors, enclosure, actual openings and overhead shelter as applicable; align supports and datums. Elevated decks need guards and actual access.","unsupported":"Screens, overhangs and openings can be constructed; no wind, corrosion, thermal or hurricane certification. No automatic circulation, engineering, service equipment or code compliance verification."}}

DESIGN AUTHORITY: The user's requirements determine the programme, site, style and scale. Choose from the brief, not a preset menu. Independently choose composition, footprint, levels, roof forms, facade organization, materials and outdoor relationships. Neither assemblies, stored recipes nor previous projects prescribe these choices. Simple or complex architecture is valid when justified by the brief. Record the selected design and its constructed relationships; no preset concepts or alternative-count requirement applies. Preserve required accommodation capacity and requested features; disclose unbuilt portions instead of shrinking the brief. Exterior scope defers interior fit-out.

